1.)This is the design I would approve for FUTMXStore:

✅ AbstractUser as the base model.
✅ Email as the login identifier (USERNAME_FIELD = "email").
✅ Keep username as an optional display name.
✅ Separate Role and UserRole tables using a composite uniqueness constraint on (user, role).
✅ Allow multiple roles per user.
✅ Make Student the default role assigned automatically during registration.
✅ Add or remove additional roles (Vendor, Course Representative, Lecturer, Admin) as users' responsibilities change.
✅ Keep authorization logic based on roles and permissions, not hard-coded user types.



